title trim page, quiet take (loudest peak -18 dBFS): the waveform scale TRUE (chip "TRUE", low bars), then key F switches to FIT (chip "FIT x8", bars scaled in the main waveform and the overview)
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_QUIET 0.12

wait 600
shot trim-true
expect text "ZOOM"
key f
wait 300
shot trim-fit-after-key
expect text "SAVE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
